## Project Structure

```
StratCraft/
├── apps/desktop/
│   └── src/
│       ├── main/           # Electron main process
│       ├── renderer/       # Frontend UI (React)
│       ├── preload/        # IPC bridge
│       └── shared/         # Shared code
├── packages/
│   ├── executor/           # C++ Executor binary
│   └── builder-templates/  # Strategy framework for Python
├── plugins/                # Bundled plugins
├── docs/                   # Design documentation
└── scripts/                # Build and utility scripts
```

