## Tech Stack

- **Electron 28** - Desktop framework
- **TypeScript** - Type safety
- **React** - UI framework
- **Webpack** - Build system
- **SQLite (better-sqlite3)** - Local database
- **C++23** - Executor engine
- **pybind11** - Python embedding
- **Apache Arrow / Parquet** - Data format

