## Logging System

**Unified log directory**: Development `apps/desktop/logs/`, Production `{userData}/logs/`

| Log Type | Development Path |
|----------|------------------|
| Electron Main | `apps/desktop/logs/main.log` |
| C++ OPS | `apps/desktop/logs/core_YYYYMMDD.log` |
| C++ TRADE | `apps/desktop/logs/trade/trade_YYYYMMDD.log` |
| C++ PLUGIN | `apps/desktop/logs/plugin/plugin_YYYYMMDD.log` |
| Console Output | `logs/output.log` |

**Log Categories**: `[APP]`, `[WINDOW]`, `[IPC]`, `[PYTHON]`, `[CPP]`, `[HEALTH]`, `[PLUGIN]`, `[GRPC]`

**Important**: Use `electron-log` for all logging in the main process. Do not use `console.log`/`console.error` - output will not be written to log files.

